                <mxCell id="_5K4IyTiggNPLRhWUsHf-268" value="This replay logic would have been a problem. If i come back immediately and the next one also ends up replaying and that happens for all of them, it&#39;ll just keep looping through until the active triangle is finished, effectively serializing it. I think it&#39;s better to replay and just leave to check the next one. There is no livelock here because the edge tester will always free up eventually, you will just lose cycles waiting for that to happen." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="_5K4IyTiggNPLRhWUsHf-1" vertex="1">
